   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250215 MSC, Munich Security Conference, Bayerischer Hof | KomÃ¶die: Amy Pope, Director General of the International Organization for Migration, participates in a dynamic discussion at the 61st Munich Security Conference. The setting highlights an exchange of ideas, with a focus on global migration challenges, amidst an attentive audience. Photo: Daniel Karmann/MSC</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
