   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250214 MSC, Munich Security Conference, Bayerischer Hof | Conference Hall: John Dramani Mahama, wearing headphones, addresses the audience at the Munich Security Conference. Seated with a microphone in hand, he engages in a discussion, with conference branding visible in the background. Photo: Stephan Goerlich/MSC</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
