   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">WASHINGTON DC, UNITED STATES - DECEMBER 8: US Secretary of War Pete Hegseth delivers remarks as him and the US Secretaries of State and Defense Marco Rubio host their Australian counterparts for bilateral talks at the State Department in Washington DC, United States on December 8, 2025. (Photo by Celal Gunes/Anadolu via Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
