   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Lee Jae Myung, South Korea's president, during a joint news conference with Sanae Takaichi, Japan's prime minister, not photographed, in Nara, Japan, on Tuesday, Jan. 13, 2026. TakaichiÂ said during a summit with LeeÂ she hopes to elevate the nations' relationship, as Tokyo moves to contain a deepening diplomatic and trade dispute with China and counter Beijing's efforts to drive a wedge between key US allies. Photographer: Eugene Hoshiko/AP Photo/Bloomberg via Getty Images</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
