   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20240217 MSC, Munich Security Conference, Bayerischer Hof - Conference Hall: President Volodymyr Zelensky addresses an attentive audience at the 60th Munich Security Conference, with the MSC logo prominently displayed in the background. Photo: Axel Heimken/MSC</rdf:li>
