   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250215 MSC, Munich Security Conference, : Mette Frederiksen, Prime Minister of Denmark, engages in a discussion at the 61st Munich Security Conference. She is seen gesturing while holding a microphone, emphasizing her points during the panel session. The backdrop features the MSC logo and Bayerischer Hof branding. Photo: Karl-Josef Hildenbrand/MSC</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
