     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250214 MSC, Munich Security Conference, : Ursula von der Leyen, President of the European Commission, speaks at the Munich Security Conference. She stands at a podium with the MSC logo, delivering a key address on European security and cooperation. Photo: Thomas Niedermueller/MSC</rdf:li>
