   </dc:subject>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250215 MSC, Munich Security Conference, : A formal interaction unfolds at the Munich Security Conference, with individuals in suits engaged in discussion. A U.S. flag pin is prominently displayed on one participant's lapel, symbolizing diplomatic presence. The elegant interior features classical sculptures and soft lighting. Photo: Jan Zappner/MSC</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
