   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">20250214 MSC, Munich Security Conference, Bayerischer Hof | Conference Hall: J. D. Vance addresses the audience at the Munich Security Conference, standing at a podium with the MSC logo. The backdrop features the conference's branding, emphasizing the event's focus on global security issues. Photo: Lennart Preiss/MSC</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
